# Thornwood Keep - Ruins

The ruins of Thornwood Keep rise from the mist like broken teeth. Once a proud fortress, it was destroyed fifty years ago in a magical catastrophe. Now only crumbling walls and a partially collapsed tower remain.

The image shows the ancient castle ruins, shrouded in an eerie mist. The air here is cold, regardless of the season.

The green light you've seen in the distance emanates from somewhere beneath the ruins -- from the old crypts below.

